      "name": "Pack Attack",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The warg's jaws Strike deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> extra damage to creatures within reach of two of the warg's allies.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Shred",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>If the warg has a creature Grabbed, it can spend one action to shred them with its teeth. The creature takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d6</span> slashing damage and can make a DC 18 basic Fortitude save.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>Wargs are often mistaken for wolves, but they have a cunning intelligence and the ability to speak. Wargs often form hunting parties with orcs and hobgoblins. Most wargs are amenable to this arrangement, but if food should run out, wargs are more than willing to integrate goblinoid flesh into their diet.</p>",
